      "value": "@{60e65f577ae9d0492b0f2a75|full_name} It should be acceptable for automatic conversion to be enabled during the open beta to identify and fix defects. I have no objection to that point.\n\nUnfortunately, since the detailed behavior of Unity Constraints is not explicitly documented, achieving full compatibility might be challenging. This post discusses the concerns if the merge to the live branch is done while leaving compatibility issues unresolved due to such factors.\n\nIf there are doubts about the feasibility of the ideal plan, a realistic second option should be considered, and the discussion about it should be done before the live release.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
