      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5e4ca2145f9b3726b3b389e7|full_name}: We do not plan on delaying the release of VRCConstraints.\n\nIf the problems are reported and marked as Tracked, we are looking at them and plan on addressing them. Those fixes will come with future updates.\n\nWe understand that big changes like this will break some older content, and that is unfortunately the cost of user-generated content at times. We do our best to mitigate these problems via feedback, bug reports, and iteration.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
